6. The diagonal flip F distinguishes B_1 from B_2: tr(P_{B_1} M_F) = +2,
   tr(P_{B_2} M_F) = -2.
7. The partition function identity is
   Z_gf = lim_{beta -> infinity} Z_sub(beta) = dim ker D = 4.
8. The 2D-to-4D gauge lift is unique up to overall scale.

